      en = { "Right-clicking a player: the |cffffd100Invite to guild|r entry is removed – WoW Forever blocks invites from this menu. To invite, use the |cffffd100Invite|r button in the guild window (opens Blizzard's invite dialog) or type |cffe6e0da/ginvite First Last|r in chat" } },
